# Indian Fabric Guides

Short, practical guides on choosing, buying and caring for Indian bridal and festive fabrics.

Written for brides, families, boutique owners, designers, students and anyone sewing with fabrics like georgette, organza, tissue, silk and Banarasi brocade.

Maintained with input from the team at [Paras Gallery Fabrics](https://parasgalleryfabrics.com/), a fabric retail and wholesale house in Lajpat Nagar, New Delhi.

## Guides

| Guide | What it covers |
